        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="IhowU3uf2Jn7Q5e3wpJi-57" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontFamily=Edu VIC WA NT Beginner;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DEdu%2BVIC%2BWA%2BNT%2BBeginner;fontSize=16;" value="Dissident" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="76" x="650" y="-1039" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="IhowU3uf2Jn7Q5e3wpJi-58" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontFamily=Edu VIC WA NT Beginner;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DEdu%2BVIC%2BWA%2BNT%2BBeginner;fontSize=16;" value="Insubordinate" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="90" x="650" y="-1009" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="IhowU3uf2Jn7Q5e3wpJi-59" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontFamily=Edu VIC WA NT Beginner;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DEdu%2BVIC%2BWA%2BNT%2BBeginner;fontSize=16;" value="Forced Truth" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="90" x="650" y="-979" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="IhowU3uf2Jn7Q5e3wpJi-64" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;108&quot; data-end=&quot;492&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Ayame Kishima (綾芽 規島) chose to leave T0K10 when her sister Noriko’s decisions stopped being theoretical and became very real sentences.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;108&quot; data-end=&quot;492&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Rather than submit or flee, she exiled herself to the mountains to build a camp capable of surviving outside the Universal System. There, she established a simple and brutal rule: only those who can endure may live.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;108&quot; data-end=&quot;492&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;In indirect contact with Noriko, who organizes the expulsions, Ayame takes in exiles left nearby, assesses them, and makes her decisions without hesitation. She does not ignore the violence of her choices, but considers them a necessary alternative to certain execution. Having become abnormal herself to fulfill this role, she embodies a clear-eyed form of survival, in which humanity is measured by what one is willing to sacrifice to preserve it.&lt;br&gt;Unlike the other Abnormals, Noriko is not marked because she left before she could be caught.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="235" width="746" x="41" y="-514" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="IhowU3uf2Jn7Q5e3wpJi-66" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontFamily=Edu VIC WA NT Beginner;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DEdu%2BVIC%2BWA%2BNT%2BBeginner;fontSize=16;movable=1;resizable=1;rotatable=1;deletable=1;editable=1;locked=0;connectable=1;" value="+1d6 / Dexterity or Strength bonus" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="190" x="100" y="-220.00000000000006" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
